\* V22-SCOPE: all-imported-defs; contracts unchanged; per-proof cited definitions only.










THEOREM InitImpliesIndInv ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Design
 PROVE Init => PinInv
 BY ONLY Sizes, Design, V22_InitClosure, PTL DEF V22_InitClosure

THEOREM IndInvImpliesSafety ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Design
 PROVE PinInv => Safety
 BY ONLY Sizes, Design, V22_SafetyClosure, PTL DEF V22_SafetyClosure

THEOREM SpecImpliesAlwaysSafety ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Design
 PROVE Spec => []Safety
 BY ONLY Sizes, Design, InitImpliesIndInv, IndInvImpliesSafety, V22_BoxedStep, PTL DEF Spec, V22_BoxedStep
====
